ets/enrollment/troubleshooting.mdx","Diagnóstico de enrolamiento","Localiza fallos de transporte, autenticación, registro, emisión e instalación.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-61/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting",{"_62":290},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting.mdx","es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment",{"_196":293},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/meta.json","<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-network shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"16\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"2\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"9\" y=\"2\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M5 16v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3\"></path><path d=\"M12 12V8\"></path></svg>",{"_39":296,"_46":57,"_41":233,"_51":297,"_59":-7,"_13":298,"_60":299},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview.mdx","Elige la política de admisión y conecta DMS, confianza inicial y cliente EST.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-61/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview",{"_62":300},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview.mdx",{"_46":47,"_41":302,"_48":-7,"_50":-7,"_51":-7,"_53":-7,"_43":303,"_39":311,"_60":312,"_59":314},"Integraciones",[304],{"_39":305,"_46":57,"_41":306,"_51":307,"_59":-7,"_13":308,"_60":309},"es:platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core.mdx","AWS IoT Core","El conector de Lamassu para AWS IoT Core sincroniza las identidades de los dispositivos con la plataforma AWS, gestionando el registro de CAs, el aprovisionamiento de Things y el ciclo de vida de los certificados de forma automática y orientada a eventos.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-61/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core",{"_62":310},"platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core.mdx","es:platform/iot-fleets/integrations",{"_196":313},"platform/iot-fleets/integrations/meta.